\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Low-level vs high-level\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 A low-level language gives little to no abstraction from the hardware and maps closer to processor instructions, so you get precise manual control. Same logic applies to orchestration: lower level equals more control, more work.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
