\f0\b \cf0 Multi-agent.
\f1\b0  LangChain 1.0 supports sub-agents, and each sub-agent can use a different model.\

\f0\b Cost.
\f1\b0  LangChain and LangGraph are free libraries. LangSmith has paid tiers (developer tier includes a trace quota). Support only exists if you buy an enterprise/paid plan; otherwise open a GitHub issue.\

\f0\b Does LangChain store anything?
\f1\b0  It runs on your machine and does not phone home. It generates run IDs locally. Data leaves only if you connect LangSmith. Works offline with Ollama.\

\f0\b Projects.
\f1\b0  7 to 10 production-grade projects planned. Early ones coded from scratch in class; later ones shipped as code and walked through. Advanced projects will cover architecture patterns, CI/CD, and infrastructure as code, where the agent is one component of the system.\
